## 7. Challenges / Difficulties Encountered in the Project

| # | Challenge | Solution |
| :-: | :--- | :--- |
| 1 | **Sensor calibration** — DHT11 warm-up delay; soil ADC fluctuation | Multi-sample averaging + analog-to-moisture mapping table |
| 2 | **MQTT stability** — Unstable campus Wi-Fi causing disconnections | Auto-reconnection logic + local MQTT broker deployment |
| 3 | **Cross-platform integration** — Arduino (C++), xiaozhi (firmware), OpenClaw (cloud) | Standardized JSON format + modular development |
| 4 | **Scheduled task accuracy** — 6-hour report drift | Cron-based scheduling with error handling & retry |
| 5 | **AI prompt engineering** — Combining sensor data with plant knowledge | Iterative prompt tuning with domain-specific context |
| 6 | **Arduino serial dependency** — `Serial.begin()` blocks without USB connection | Timeout mechanism: skip serial init if not ready, proceed to MQTT |

