### Conclusion

Plant Pal successfully validates the integration of **IoT sensing + cloud AI + voice interaction**:

- MQTT enables reliable, lightweight sensor data transmission.
- Cloud AI agents deliver meaningful health assessments from sensor data.
- Voice interfaces make plant care accessible and intuitive.
- Modular JSON-based architecture integrates heterogeneous platforms seamlessly.

